{"error":"No Claude auth token found at <GM_ROOT>/home/.config/rip-cage/secrets/CCTOK.\nOne-time human step:\n  1. Run 'claude setup-token' in a terminal (prints a long-lived OAuth token).\n  2. Save the printed token to <GM_ROOT>/home/.config/rip-cage/secrets/CCTOK\n  3. chmod 600 <GM_ROOT>/home/.config/rip-cage/secrets/CCTOK\nTo use ANTHROPIC_API_KEY instead, delete the secrets: CCTOK block and the CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN env line from this cage's config.","code":"AUTH_CCTOK_INVALID"}